Subject: [PATCH 13/27] test(fusion): isolate typed cache fixture mutations

Copy the self-contained typed fixture to a test-owned temporary directory before exercising content-based cache invalidation. Preserve cache-hit, stored-edge and exactly-two-package reload assertions.

Verified: unchanged original test passed while an integrity observer detected tracked direct.go changing from 176 to 188 bytes. Fixed test passes normally and under race with zero observed tracked mutations and unchanged original content and mtime. Independent source review found no issues. Canonical gate and cold qualification remain pending.
